{
  "schema": 1,
  "note": "The one table of SENSITIVE text markers. src/lib/friday/brain/memory-policy.ts, electron/privacy-firewall.cjs and kernel/privacy.py all read it; add or change a marker here, nowhere else. pattern is a regular expression that means the same in JavaScript and Python (no named groups, lookbehind is one character wide); flags is i or empty. kind groups markers, lang is en, hi or hinglish, label is the plain reason shown to the owner. A Hindi or Roman Hindi word that is also everyday talk (password, PIN, token, Aadhaar) counts only with its value: a 4+ digit run or a code-like token; for the secret words (password, PIN, OTP, CVV) also any digit run, a spelled-digit run or any other word of 3+ letters that follows है, hai, is, : or = (or stands before है or hai), unless it is a question, filler or stop word from the words lists below (a bare question such as mera pin kya hai stays ordinary); a six-digit PIN code is a postal code, a four-digit PIN is a secret. Every reader first runs the normalise section over the text (and still matches the raw text). Financial and identity numbers (cards, Aadhaar, PAN, passport, SSN) are checked by code, not by this table. A pattern may hold {{name}} placeholders: {{words.list}} is a word list from words joined with |, any other name is a piece from fragments; every reader expands them the same way before compiling, and an unknown name stops everything like an unreadable table.",
  "normalise": {
    "note": "Applied by every reader before the markers are matched (the raw text is matched too): NFKC, drop joiner characters, fold other-script digits to 0-9, lower-case, fold a run of at least minRun single letters spaced or dotted apart (O T P, ओ.टी.पी.) and the listed split words (pass word) into one word. letter, marks, guard and separators are regular-expression class bodies.",
    "form": "NFKC",
    "lowercase": true,
    "dropChars": ["00ad", "200b", "200c", "200d", "2060", "feff"],
    "digitRanges": [
      ["0660", "0669"],
      ["06f0", "06f9"],
      ["0966", "096f"],
      ["09e6", "09ef"],
      ["0ae6", "0aef"]
    ],
    "separators": " \\t.\\-",
    "minRun": 3,
    "units": [
      {
        "letter": "a-z",
        "marks": "",
        "guard": "a-z0-9"
      },
      {
        "letter": "\\u0904-\\u0939\\u0958-\\u095f",
        "marks": "\\u0900-\\u0903\\u093a-\\u094f\\u0951-\\u0957",
        "guard": "\\u0900-\\u097f"
      }
    ],
    "joinPairs": [
      {
        "parts": ["pass", "word"],
        "guard": "a-z0-9"
      },
      {
        "parts": ["pass", "code"],
        "guard": "a-z0-9"
      },
      {
        "parts": ["पास", "वर्ड"],
        "guard": "\\u0900-\\u097f"
      },
      {
        "parts": ["पास", "कोड"],
        "guard": "\\u0900-\\u097f"
      }
    ]
  },
